{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09465","headline":"乌引雏 · 韦应物","name":"乌引雏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出照东城，春乌鵶鵶雏和鸣。\n雏和鸣，羽犹短，巢在深林春正寒，引飞欲集东城暖。\n羣雏䙰褷睥睨高，举翅不及坠蓬蒿。\n雄雌来去飞又引，音声上下惧鹰隼。\n引雏乌，尔心急将何如，何得比日搜索雀卵噉尔雏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}